  "one puts both ds screens' menus together on one screen. two shows the two screens side by side.": "单屏将菜单合在同一画面；双屏并排显示原版的两个屏幕。",
  "menu\nart": "菜单\n背景",
  "samus behind the menus: one of your imported suits, shuffle (another one each time the game starts), or original (the ds picture).": "选择菜单背景中的萨姆斯装甲。可选已导入的装甲、随机切换，或保留原版。",
  "smooth\nmenus": "菜单\n锐化",
  "on draws the menu art clean and sharp. off filters it softer.": "开启后菜单图像更锐利，关闭后更柔和。",
  "line\nart": "HUD\n线条",
  "smooth redraws the hud's line art as clean lines and shapes, traced from your rom. pixel keeps the ds pixels.": "平滑重绘 HUD 的线条和形状；像素保留 DS 原版样式。",
  "frame\nrate": "帧率",
  "smooth\nframes": "帧间\n平滑",
  "music\nquality": "音乐\n品质",
  "controls\npage": "操控\n界面",
  "options > controls and the ship's options. new: the control customizer. classic: the ds's stylus and dual mode boxes.": "新版：可自定义按键；经典：DS 触控笔和双键选项。",
  "developer": "开发者",
  "status\ntext": "状态\n文字",
  "the upper-left text in gameplay: fps, timings, the scoreboard. l3 cycles it.": "游戏左上角显示帧率、耗时或记分牌。按 L3 循环切换。",
  "dev\ntools": "开发\n工具",
  "import\ngames": "导入\n游戏",
  "samus\nsuit": "萨姆斯\n装甲",
  "camera": "镜头",
  "the campaign's camera. first person is the game's own view. third person follows samus from behind, wearing her suit's body.": "冒险模式视角。第一人称为原版视角；第三人称跟随萨姆斯身后。",
  "match\ncamera": "对战\n镜头",
  "the camera in multiplayer matches. third person follows your hunter from behind in bot and lan matches. online matches are always first person.": "机器人和局域网对战支持第三人称。在线对战始终采用第一人称。",
  "map\nlook": "地图\n样式",
  "map: the game's own map models. detailed: every room drawn from its real shape. y switches it in the map.": "原版显示游戏地图模型，详细模式按实际地形绘制。可在地图中按 Y 切换。",
  "map\nmode": "地图\n模式",
  "prime: only rooms and corridors you've been in. move freely, the d-pad hops rooms. hunters: the game's own.": "究极模式只显示已到访区域，可自由移动或用十字键切换房间。Hunters 为原版。",
  "prime: in the campaign a radar plus a mini map of the room you're in. ds: the game's own.": "究极：冒险模式显示雷达与房间小地图。DS：原版界面。",
  "change which buttons do what, and how quickly you turn and aim.": "自定义按键、转向速度和瞄准灵敏度。",
  "gyro\naim": "体感\n瞄准",
  "turn the device to fine-tune your aim. the right stick still turns as usual. zoom: only while zoomed or scanning.": "转动设备微调瞄准，右摇杆仍可转向。放大模式仅在放大或扫描时启用。",
  "gyro\nspeed": "体感\n速度",
  "how far the view turns for each turn of the device. 100% turns it the same angle.": "调整体感转向倍率。100% 时，视角转过的角度和设备一致。",
  "reset\ngyro speed": "重置\n体感速度",
  "gyro\naxis": "体感\n轴向",
  "yaw: the screen's own up axis. player: true up, however you hold it. roll: tilt to steer.": "偏航以屏幕竖轴为准；世界以实际竖直方向为准；横滚通过侧倾控制。",
  "touch\ncontrols": "触屏\n操控",
  "touch\naim": "触屏\n瞄准",
  "how the right-hand finger aims. stylus: drag to turn the view, as on the ds. stick: a floating stick.": "触控笔模式拖动转向，摇杆模式使用浮动虚拟摇杆。",
  "record\nreplays": "录制\n回放",
  "on records every match against bots and keeps the last ten. off records nothing.": "开启后录制与机器人的对战，并保留最近十局。",
  "unlocks": "解锁",
  "multiplayer hunters and arenas. vanilla: earned as in the original game. all: every one open.": "解锁多人猎人和竞技场。原版按原规则解锁；全部直接开放。",
